{"text":". 2023;","rect":[516.88717768,252.07509670000007,536.98955494,259.0596967000001],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"25(2):179-198. doi:10.5853/jos.2022.02936","rect":[391.60650286000003,243.09499648000008,517.16376784,250.07959648000008],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"3","rect":[391.60650286000003,231.12129670000007,395.30834086000004,238.10589670000007],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":". Douek PC, Boccalini S, Oei EHG, et al. Clinical","rect":[395.30834086000004,231.12129670000007,527.0623429600003,238.10589670000007],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"applications of photon-counting CT: a review of","rect":[391.60650286000003,222.14119648000008,526.0740220600001,229.12579648000008],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"pioneer studies and a glimpse into the future.","rect":[391.60650286000003,213.16109626000008,520.4688805600002,220.14569626000008],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"Radiology","rect":[391.60650286000003,204.18099604000008,419.4443246199999,211.16559604000008],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":". 2023;309(1):e222432. doi:10.1148/radiol.","rect":[419.41918006000003,204.18099604000008,539.4474356799994,211.16559604000008],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"222432","rect":[391.60650286000003,195.20089582000008,413.32511656,202.18549582000009],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"Figure 2. Comparison of Collateral Vessels and Distal Circulation on Ultrahigh-Resolution","rect":[72.3118,716.4567,347.34614035,723.9402],"fontSize":7.4835},{"text":"Photon-Counting Computed Tomographic Angiography Before and After Angioplasty","rect":[72.3118,706.47894945,338.92720284999973,713.96244945],"fontSize":7.4835},{"text":"Before angioplasty","rect":[84.5276,685.6061,134.27275,692.1061],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"A","rect":[74.9707,685.825,78.6822,691.6750000000001],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"Postangioplasty follow-up at 8 mo","rect":[319.9028,685.6061,411.23364999999995,692.1061],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"B","rect":[310.4278,685.825,313.97679999999997,691.6750000000001],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"R","rect":[80.1565,460.3972,83.85499999999999,466.8972],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"L","rect":[293.15695,460.3972,296.28995,466.8972],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"R","rect":[316.1572,460.3972,319.8557,466.8972],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"L","rect":[529.1569999999999,460.3972,532.29,466.8972],"fontSize":6.5},{"text":"Coronal volume-rendered ultrahigh-resolution photon-counting computed","rect":[72.3118,439.5345,285.16748499999994,446.5191],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"tomographic angiographic images were obtained before angioplasty (A) and 8","rect":[72.3118,430.55439978,293.9177918799999,437.53899978],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"months after left external carotid artery angioplasty (B). The 8-month follow-up","rect":[72.3118,421.57429956,299.13109731999987,428.55889956],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"ultrahigh-resolution photon-counting computed tomographic angiography","rect":[72.3118,412.59419934,285.17796189999996,419.57879934],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"demonstrated increased caliber and number of collateral vessels (arrowheads),","rect":[72.3118,403.61409912,296.61524439999994,410.59869912],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"with more pronounced enhancement on the left side and moderate","rect":[311.78370022,439.53519846,503.7721942600002,446.51979846],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"improvement on the right side. Yellow arrowheads demonstrate collateral","rect":[311.78370022,430.55509824,521.2078512400001,437.53969824],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"vessels of the external carotid artery superficial temporal and maxillary arteries,","rect":[311.78370022,421.57499802,537.9436513000002,428.55959802],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"whereas the blue arrowheads identify distal collateral vessels originating from","rect":[311.78370022,412.5948978,532.72825048,419.5794978],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"the left middle cerebral artery. L indicates left; R, right.","rect":[311.78370022,403.61479758,466.56872236000027,410.59939758],"fontSize":6.9846},{"text":"Clinical Review & Education","rect":[72.3118,754.3729,152.97205618000